There is a www-site about climbing in Europe:

It contains climbing area information from several countries in Europe with 
references to other places with info about climbing in Europe.

It also contains a list of climbing walls within Europe.

It can be accessed through the internet:



URL address:	   http://www.eeb.ele.tue.nl/climbing/index.html



I try to gather this info for you!

If you have any info share it with the rest of the world.

You can email the info directly to me in plain ascii of html format.

You can also design your own site with info about a specific area or a
country or otherwise. I can put it on the net for you or I can reference to
it, whatever you want. Look for examples into my site: Freyr (Belgium),
Fountainbleau (France), the UK, Frankenjura (Germany), Ireland.


I can only share more info with the rest of the world when I receive it from
you, so start writing and sending info to me.

Roy.